FailAt 10
If NOT EXISTS SYS:TuringStats
 Echo "Install TuringStats first."
 Quit 20
EndIf
Copy SYS:TuringStats SYS:WBStartup/TuringStats
Copy SYS:TuringStats.info SYS:WBStartup/TuringStats.info
Protect SYS:WBStartup/TuringStats +e
Echo "TuringStats will start at boot when its USB display is present."
Echo "If the display is absent, startup skips it quietly."
